{"id":"50df0572bbd651eb","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-validity.md","title":"GL Validity","display":"df-gl-validity — GL Validity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-validity","aliases":["89-df-gl-validity"],"display":"df-gl-validity — GL Validity","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-frame]]","[[89-df-valid-modal]]","[[89-df-modal-formula]]"],"revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-validity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-validity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-validity — GL Validity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c6ab46cd662b1409\" href=\"?note=c6ab46cd662b1409\" title=\"89-df-gl-frame\">89-df-gl-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dbba58e7bd3b0667\" href=\"?note=dbba58e7bd3b0667\" title=\"89-df-valid-modal\">89-df-valid-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLFrame}\">\\(\\mathrm{GLFrame}\\)</span> is the frame predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c6ab46cd662b1409\" href=\"?note=c6ab46cd662b1409\" title=\"89-df-gl-frame\">89-df-gl-frame</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall F\">\\(\\forall F\\)</span> 遍历满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)\\)</span> 的集合对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=(W,R)\">\\(F=(W,R)\\)</span>；框架有效性与框架性质只在此域上调用。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}validity}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Valid}_{G\\!L}\\coloneqq\n\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\mid\n\\forall F\\;(\\mathrm{GLFrame}(F)\\to F\\models A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}validity}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Valid}_{G\\!L}\\coloneqq\n\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\mid\n\\forall F\\;(\\mathrm{GLFrame}(F)\\to F\\models A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>GL有效公式在所有GL框架上成立</li>\n<li>GL框架是传递且逆良基的</li>\n<li>GL有效性对应可证明性</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c6ab46cd662b1409","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-valid-modal","status":"resolved","id":"dbba58e7bd3b0667","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-valid-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c6ab46cd662b1409","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GLFrame}$ is the frame predicate from [[89-df-gl-frame]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLFrame}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"F=(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}validity}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Valid}_{G\\!L}\\coloneqq\n\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\mid\n\\forall F\\;(\\mathrm{GLFrame}(F)\\to F\\models A)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":847,"backlinks":[{"id":"4ff9b90c9fb9c1d5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Valid}_{G\\!L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ is from\n[[89-df-gl-validity]]."},{"id":"481523784df01f70","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Valid}_{G\\!L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ is from\n[[89-df-gl-validity]]."},{"id":"ba8612f4bcb9f360","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"记号与 [[89-df-gl-validity]] 的输出\n$\\mathrm{Valid}_{G\\!L}$ 完全一致，不再引入第二套有效性缩写。"},{"id":"112ea3be2012fd1b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Valid}_{G\\!L}$ 是 [[89-df-gl-validity]] 的实际输出记号；\n不另设第二套有效性缩写。"},{"id":"0157f8bea9275cf1","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"结论记号与 [[89-df-gl-validity]] 的输出保持一致。"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-321","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-validity]]"}],"outgoing":["c6ab46cd662b1409","dbba58e7bd3b0667","56c1b5b75a32ca1d"]}